{
  "id": "PSA.65",
  "number": "65",
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "reference": "Psaumes 65",
  "copyright": "Texte libre de droits",
  "verseCount": 14,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "65",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PSA 65"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "65",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 65:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Au chef de musique. Psaume de David. Cantique.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.65.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.65.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 65:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ô",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.65.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.65.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.65.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.65.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! la louange t'attend dans le silence en Sion, et le vœu te sera payé.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.65.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.65.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 65:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ô toi qui écoutes la prière ! toute chair viendra à toi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.65.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.65.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 65:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Les iniquités ont prévalu sur moi ; nos transgressions, toi tu les pardonneras",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.65.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.65.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.65.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.65.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 65:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bienheureux celui que tu as choisi et que tu fais approcher : il habitera tes parvis. Nous serons rassasiés du bien",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.65.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.65.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "de ta maison, de ton saint temple.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.65.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.65.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 65:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tu nous répondras par des choses terribles de justice",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.65.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.65.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", ô",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.65.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.65.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.65.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.65.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "de notre salut, toi qui es la confiance de tous les bouts de la terre, et des régions lointaines de la mer !",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.65.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.65.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 65:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toi qui as établi les montagnes par ta force, qui es ceint de puissance,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.65.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.65.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 65:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qui apaises le tumulte des mers, le tumulte de leurs flots, et l'agitation des peuplades.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.65.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.65.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 65:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Et ceux qui habitent aux bouts [de la terre] craindront à la vue de tes prodiges",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.65.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.65.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; tu fais chanter de joie les sorties du matin et du soir",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.65.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.65.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.65.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.65.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 65:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tu as visité la terre, tu l'as abreuvée, tu l'enrichis abondamment : le ruisseau de",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.65.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.65.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.65.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.65.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "est plein d'eau. Tu prépares les",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.65.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.65.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "blés, quand tu l'as ainsi préparée.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.65.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.65.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 65:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tu arroses ses sillons, tu aplanis ses mottes, tu l'amollis par des ondées, tu bénis son germe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.65.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.65.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 65:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tu couronnes l'année de ta bonté, et tes sentiers distillent la graisse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.65.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.65.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 65:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ils distillent sur les pâturages du désert, et les collines se ceignent d'allégresse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.65.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.65.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 65:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Les prairies se revêtent de menu bétail, et les plaines sont couvertes de froment : elles poussent des cris de triomphe ; oui, elles chantent.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.65.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.65.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "PSA.66",
    "number": "66",
    "bookId": "PSA"
  },
  "previous": {
    "id": "PSA.64",
